<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Propper waiting time to call "Resupply" stratagem.</Major>
    <Description>How to:
Set your Stratagems button to "press". 
Choose Arrows for stratagems in Options. 

I use it like this, example:
Setting macros for this buttons with modificator, in my case it`s Ctrl+

"1" - support weapon
"2" - back pack
"3" - 1st stratagem
"4" - 2nd stratagem

And mouse wheel for - Reinfoce</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 224 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 81 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 81 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 81 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 81 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 82 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 82 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 79 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 79 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 224 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Helldivers 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>